<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Your Subscription is Active</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background-color: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0; }
    .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; }
    .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #2563eb; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 15px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Welcome to your {{planName}} Plan!</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
      <p>Thank you for subscribing! Your account has been successfully upgraded to the <strong>{{planName}}</strong> plan.</p>
      <p>You now have full access to all the premium features included in your subscription.</p>
      <p>To manage your subscription or view your billing history, you can access your billing portal at any time.</p>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{manageLink}}" class="button">Manage Subscription</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Cloud Console. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
